{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36627","headline":"酬黄从事怀旧见寄 · 罗隐","name":"酬黄从事怀旧见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧游不合到心中，把得君诗意亦同。\n水馆酒阑清夜月，香街人散白杨风。\n长绳系日虽难绊，辨口谈天不易穷。\n世事自随蓬转在，思量何处是飞蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}